    '<strong>Access control</strong> determines whether the user is allowed to carry out the action that they are attempting to perform.' => '<strong>Kontrol akses</strong> menentukan apakah pengguna diizinkan menjalankan aksi yang dicoba.',
    'Broken access controls are common and often present a critical security vulnerability. Design and management of access controls is a complex and dynamic problem that applies business, organizational, and legal constraints to a technical implementation. Access control design decisions have to be made by humans so the potential for errors is high.' => 'Celah kontrol akses sangat umum dan sering berisiko kritis, karena merancang aturan bisnis, peran organisasi, dan batasan teknis secara konsisten rawan kelalaian manusia.',
    'Access control security models' => 'Model keamanan kontrol akses',
    'Vertical access controls' => 'Kontrol akses vertikal',
    'Vertical access controls are mechanisms that restrict access to sensitive functionality to specific types of users.' => 'Kontrol akses vertikal membatasi fungsi sensitif hanya untuk kategori peran pengguna tertentu.',
    "With vertical access controls, different types of users have access to different application functions. For example, an administrator might be able to modify or delete any user's account, while an ordinary user has no access to these actions. Vertical access controls can be more fine-grained implementations of security models designed to enforce business policies such as separation of duties and least privilege." => 'Pengguna dengan peran berbeda memperoleh hak fungsi berbeda; misalnya administrator dapat menghapus akun pengguna lain sedangkan pengguna biasa tidak boleh, guna menerapkan pemisahan tugas dan hak minimum.',
    'Horizontal access controls' => 'Kontrol akses horizontal',
    'Horizontal access controls are mechanisms that restrict access to resources to specific users.' => 'Kontrol akses horizontal membatasi akses sumber daya agar hanya terbuka bagi pemiliknya.',
    'With horizontal access controls, different users have access to a subset of resources of the same type. For example, a banking application will allow a user to view transactions and make payments from their own accounts, but not the accounts of any other user.' => 'Pengguna hanya boleh mengakses sumber daya bertipe sama milik dirinya sendiri, seperti melihat mutasi rekening pribadi tanpa bisa melihat rekening nasabah lain.',
    'Context-dependent access controls' => 'Kontrol akses berbasis konteks',
    "Context-dependent access controls restrict access to functionality and resources based upon the state of the application or the user's interaction with it." => 'Kontrol akses berbasis konteks membatasi akses menurut status alur aplikasi atau urutan interaksi pengguna.',
    'Context-dependent access controls prevent a user performing actions in the wrong order. For example, a retail website might prevent users from modifying the contents of their shopping cart after they have made payment.' => 'Mekanisme ini mencegah pengguna menjalankan langkah di luar urutan semestinya, misalnya mengubah keranjang belanja setelah pembayaran selesai.',
    'Examples of broken access controls' => 'Contoh celah kontrol akses',
    'Broken access control vulnerabilities exist when a user can access resources or perform actions that they are not supposed to be able to.' => 'Kerentanan kontrol akses terjadi ketika pengguna dapat membuka sumber daya atau menjalankan aksi di luar kewenangannya.',
    'Vertical privilege escalation' => 'Eskalasi hak istimewa vertikal',
    'If a user can gain access to functionality that they are not permitted to access then this is vertical privilege escalation. For example, if a non-administrative user can gain access to an admin page where they can delete user accounts, then this is vertical privilege escalation.' => 'Jika pengguna biasa berhasil mengakses fungsi khusus admin seperti menghapus akun orang lain, kondisi ini disebut eskalasi hak istimewa vertikal.',
    'Unprotected functionality' => 'Fungsionalitas tanpa perlindungan',
    "At its most basic, vertical privilege escalation arises where an application does not enforce any protection for sensitive functionality. For example, administrative functions might be linked from an administrator's welcome page but not from a user's welcome page. However, a user might be able to access the administrative functions by browsing to the relevant admin URL." => 'Bentuk paling mendasar terjadi saat fitur sensitif tidak dilindungi pemeriksaan hak akses sehingga pengguna biasa cukup mengetik URL admin secara langsung.',
    'For example, a website might host sensitive functionality at the following URL:' => 'Misalnya, panel admin diletakkan langsung di URL berikut:',
