    "This script adds a link to the user's UI if they are an admin user. However, the script containing the URL is visible to all users regardless of their role." => 'Walaupun tautan hanya dirender jika berstatus admin, seluruh skrip berisi path admin tetap dapat dilihat siapa saja.',
    'Parameter-based access control methods' => 'Kontrol akses berbasis parameter',
    "Some applications determine the user's access rights or role at login, and then store this information in a user-controllable location. This could be:" => 'Sebagian aplikasi menentukan hak akses saat login lalu menyimpan penanda peran di tempat yang bisa diubah pengguna, seperti:',
    'A hidden field.' => 'Field formulir tersembunyi (hidden field).',
    'A cookie.' => 'Cookie browser.',
    'A preset query string parameter.' => 'Parameter query string bawaan.',
