    'IDOR vulnerabilities often arise when sensitive resources are located in static files on the server-side filesystem. For example, a website might save chat message transcripts to disk using an incrementing filename, and allow users to retrieve these by visiting a URL like the following:' => 'IDOR juga muncul saat dokumen sensitif seperti transkrip percakapan disimpan sebagai file bernomor urut di server:',
    'In this situation, an attacker can simply modify the filename to retrieve a transcript created by another user and potentially obtain user credentials and other sensitive data.' => 'Penyerang cukup mengganti nomor nama file tersebut untuk mengunduh transkrip milik pengguna lain.',
